  "Meeting Etiquette": "Meeting Etiquette",
  "会议礼仪": "会议礼仪",
  "Chinese business meetings value punctuality, hierarchy, and ritual. Understanding these norms earns trust.": "Chinese business meetings value punctuality, hierarchy, and ritual. Understanding these norms earns trust.",
  "中国商务会议重视准时、等级和仪式。了解这些规范有助于赢得信任。": "中国商务会议重视准时、等级和仪式。了解这些规范有助于赢得信任。",
  "me-1": "me-1",
  "Punctuality": "Punctuality",
  "准时到达": "准时到达",
  "Arrive 5–10 minutes early. Being late is disrespectful and damages your reputation.": "Arrive 5–10 minutes early. Being late is disrespectful and damages your reputation.",
  "提前5-10分钟到达。迟到是不尊重，会损害你的声誉。": "提前5-10分钟到达。迟到是不尊重，会损害你的声誉。",
  "Arriving exactly on time or late, even by a few minutes.": "Arriving exactly on time or late, even by a few minutes.",
  "踩点到达或迟到，哪怕只晚几分钟。": "踩点到达或迟到，哪怕只晚几分钟。",
  "In Chinese business culture, punctuality demonstrates seriousness and reliability.": "In Chinese business culture, punctuality demonstrates seriousness and reliability.",
  "在中国商务文化中，准时体现认真态度和可靠形象。": "在中国商务文化中，准时体现认真态度和可靠形象。",
  "me-2": "me-2",
  "Gift Protocol": "Gift Protocol",
  "礼品礼仪": "礼品礼仪",
  "Present gifts with both hands. Gifts are usually not opened immediately.": "Present gifts with both hands. Gifts are usually not opened immediately.",
  "双手递送礼品。对方通常不会当场打开礼品。": "双手递送礼品。对方通常不会当场打开礼品。",
  "Handing over a gift with one hand, or pressuring the recipient to open it.": "Handing over a gift with one hand, or pressuring the recipient to open it.",
  "单手递礼品，或催促对方当场打开。": "单手递礼品，或催促对方当场打开。",
  "Gifts carry symbolic meaning. Presenting with two hands = respect. Opening immediately is considered greedy.": "Gifts carry symbolic meaning. Presenting with two hands = respect. Opening immediately is considered greedy.",
  "礼品有象征意义。双手递送=尊重。当场打开显得贪婪。": "礼品有象征意义。双手递送=尊重。当场打开显得贪婪。",
