  "Hierarchy in Speech": "Hierarchy in Speech",
  "发言顺序": "发言顺序",
  "The most senior person speaks first. Allow seniors to set the agenda and direction.": "The most senior person speaks first. Allow seniors to set the agenda and direction.",
  "职位最高者先发言。允许上级主导议程和方向。": "职位最高者先发言。允许上级主导议程和方向。",
