  "在上司发言前就开始汇报或下结论。": "在上司发言前就开始汇报或下结论。",
  "Speaking out of turn disrupts the hierarchy. Wait for the senior person to open the floor.": "Speaking out of turn disrupts the hierarchy. Wait for the senior person to open the floor.",
