  "Accommodation Arrangement:\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\n\nAll expenses including travel, accommodation, and local transportation will be:\n[ ] borne by the hosting company\n[ ] shared between both parties\n[ ] borne by the invited party\n\n住宿安排：\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\n\n行程、住宿及本地交通费用：\n[ ] 由邀请方承担\n[ ] 双方分担\n[ ] 被邀请方自行承担": "Accommodation Arrangement:\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\n\nAll expenses including travel, accommodation, and local transportation will be:\n[ ] borne by the hosting company\n[ ] shared between both parties\n[ ] borne by the invited party\n\n住宿安排：\n[ACCOMMODATION_DETAILS]\n\n行程、住宿及本地交通费用：\n[ ] 由邀请方承担\n[ ] 双方分担\n[ ] 被邀请方自行承担",
  "Invitation Guarantee": "Invitation Guarantee",
  "We hereby guarantee that [GUEST_NAME] will comply with Chinese laws and regulations during their stay in China and will leave the country before the expiration of their authorized stay.\n\n我们特此担保，[GUEST_NAME]在华期间将遵守中国法律法规，并在授权停留期满前离境。": "We hereby guarantee that [GUEST_NAME] will comply with Chinese laws and regulations during their stay in China and will leave the country before the expiration of their authorized stay.\n\n我们特此担保，[GUEST_NAME]在华期间将遵守中国法律法规，并在授权停留期满前离境。",
