  "critical contract negotiation with deadline approaching": "critical contract negotiation with deadline approaching",
  "合同谈判临近截止日期": "合同谈判临近截止日期",
  "finalizing the supply agreement before the fiscal quarter closes": "finalizing the supply agreement before the fiscal quarter closes",
  "在财季结束前敲定供货协议": "在财季结束前敲定供货协议",
  "How do I book a translator on short notice?": "How do I book a translator on short notice?",
  "如何紧急预约翻译服务？": "如何紧急预约翻译服务？",
  "Many agencies offer rush services with 24–48 hours notice. For consecutive interpreting, a same-day booking is possible in major cities (Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou) with a 50–100% rush surcharge. Simultaneous interpreting requires at least 3–5 days for equipment preparation.": "Many agencies offer rush services with 24–48 hours notice. For consecutive interpreting, a same-day booking is possible in major cities (Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou) with a 50–100% rush surcharge. Simultaneous interpreting requires at least 3–5 days for equipment preparation.",
  "许多翻译机构提供24-48小时通知的加急服务。同声传译在大城市（北京、上海、广州）可当天预约，需加收50-100%加急费。同声传译需要至少3-5天准备设备。": "许多翻译机构提供24-48小时通知的加急服务。同声传译在大城市（北京、上海、广州）可当天预约，需加收50-100%加急费。同声传译需要至少3-5天准备设备。",
  "What credentials should I look for in a translator?": "What credentials should I look for in a translator?",
  "选择翻译员应该看哪些资质？": "选择翻译员应该看哪些资质？",
  "Look for: (1) A recognized translation qualification (e.g., CATTI — China Accreditation Test for Translators and Interpreters), (2) Industry experience — a legal translator should have law background, (3) Native-level fluency in the target language, (4) Reviews from previous corporate clients.": "Look for: (1) A recognized translation qualification (e.g., CATTI — China Accreditation Test for Translators and Interpreters), (2) Industry experience — a legal translator should have law background, (3) Native-level fluency in the target language, (4) Reviews from previous corporate clients.",
  "查看：(1) 认可的翻译资质（如CATTI——全国翻译专业资格水平考试），(2) 行业经验——法律翻译需有法律背景，(3) 目标语言的母语水平，(4) 此前企业客户评价。": "查看：(1) 认可的翻译资质（如CATTI——全国翻译专业资格水平考试），(2) 行业经验——法律翻译需有法律背景，(3) 目标语言的母语水平，(4) 此前企业客户评价。",
  "Can translators help with WeChat communication during meetings?": "Can translators help with WeChat communication during meetings?",
  "翻译员能在会议期间协助微信沟通吗？": "翻译员能在会议期间协助微信沟通吗？",
  "Yes. Some interpreters also provide on-site WeChat support, helping with translating messages, explaining local payment apps, and assisting with any real-time digital communication needs during the visit.": "Yes. Some interpreters also provide on-site WeChat support, helping with translating messages, explaining local payment apps, and assisting with any real-time digital communication needs during the visit.",
  "可以。部分译员也提供现场微信支持，在访问期间帮助翻译消息、解释本地支付APP，以及协助任何实时数字沟通需求。": "可以。部分译员也提供现场微信支持，在访问期间帮助翻译消息、解释本地支付APP，以及协助任何实时数字沟通需求。",
  "How are travel expenses calculated for off-site interpreting?": "How are travel expenses calculated for off-site interpreting?",
  "场外口译的差旅费用如何计算？": "场外口译的差旅费用如何计算？",
  "Travel expenses are typically added on top of the day rate. This includes round-trip transportation (flights, trains, car rental) and accommodation if the event is outside the interpreter's city. Get a full cost breakdown before confirming.": "Travel expenses are typically added on top of the day rate. This includes round-trip transportation (flights, trains, car rental) and accommodation if the event is outside the interpreter's city. Get a full cost breakdown before confirming.",
  "差旅费用通常在日费基础上另计。包括往返交通（机票、高铁、包车）和住宿（如活动在译员所在城市以外）。确认前请获取完整费用明细。": "差旅费用通常在日费基础上另计。包括往返交通（机票、高铁、包车）和住宿（如活动在译员所在城市以外）。确认前请获取完整费用明细。",
  "Do I need certified translation for my visa application?": "Do I need certified translation for my visa application?",
  "申请签证需要认证翻译吗？": "申请签证需要认证翻译吗？",
  "Most Chinese embassies and visa centers require certified translation for all supporting documents. The certification must come from a licensed translation agency with an official seal. Documents must include the translator's name and certification number.": "Most Chinese embassies and visa centers require certified translation for all supporting documents. The certification must come from a licensed translation agency with an official seal. Documents must include the translator's name and certification number.",
  "大多数中国驻外使领馆和签证中心要求所有证明文件提供认证翻译。认证须来自持有许可证的翻译机构并加盖公章。文件须包含译员姓名和认证编号。": "大多数中国驻外使领馆和签证中心要求所有证明文件提供认证翻译。认证须来自持有许可证的翻译机构并加盖公章。文件须包含译员姓名和认证编号。",
